                                                "sense_id": "8cb4d2f6-2bb5-37d4-8967-3c0ee1ab7301",
                                                "text": "Several reports on user behavior indicate that website visitors like hypertext links, and often choose these before anything on the main menu. However, if there are no hyperlinks on the main page, visitors are forced to study the menu more closely."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c2bae7c-4c14-436c-9180-e5a5b5b82352",
                                                "sense_id": "8cb4d2f6-2bb5-37d4-8967-3c0ee1ab7301",
                                                "text": "MySpace has since expanded options to allow up to the Top 40 friends to be displayed on the main page of your profile."
                                            },
